{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the Silent School is a first-person horror game where players control a drone to investigate an abandoned Japanese school. Collect data to uncover the truth hidden within its haunted halls, while using your camera to capture and destroy vengeful ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after a tragic massacre in the school, the government has launched a covert investigation to uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Operator, remotely controlling a drone tasked with collecting data and surviving nightly missions inside the haunted school. But the spirits trapped within are not passive. They are watching. They are angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture ghosts with your camera to destroy them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect data to uncover the truth. Reach 50% or face a bad ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Limited time each night. 15 minutes to explore, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric horror inspired by Japanese folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover notes written by the victims and piece together the mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two different endings: Good and Bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2866690?t=1755990653","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2866690?t=1755990653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755990653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2866690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755990653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3968510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the Silent School is a first-person horror game where players control a drone to investigate an abandoned Japanese school. Collect data to uncover the truth hidden within its haunted halls, while using your camera to capture and destroy vengeful ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after a tragic massacre in the school, the government has launched a covert investigation to uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Operator, remotely controlling a drone tasked with collecting data and surviving nightly missions inside the haunted school. But the spirits trapped within are not passive. They are watching. They are angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture ghosts with your camera to destroy them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect data to uncover the truth. Reach 50% or face a bad ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Limited time each night. 15 minutes to explore, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric horror inspired by Japanese folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover notes written by the victims and piece together the mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two different endings: Good and Bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Daniel Henriques"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co